    "custom_liquid_QWbLRi": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .batana-timeline {\n    background-color: #EEEEE4;\n    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 56px) clamp(20px, 6vw, 56px);\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 52px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    color: #1B3B2F;\n    margin: 0 0 clamp(24px, 5vw, 40px) 0;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__card {\n    background-color: #FBF8ED;\n    border: 1px solid #D9D6C6;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px);\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: clamp(14px, 2.5vw, 20px);\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__dot {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: clamp(28px, 4vw, 36px);\n    height: clamp(28px, 4vw, 36px);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #4FA187;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__dot span {\n    width: 45%;\n    height: 45%;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #1B3B2F;\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__badge {\n    background-color: #F2B84D;\n    color: #1B3B2F;\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: clamp(12px, 1.8vw, 14px);\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__title {\n    font-size: clamp(17px, 2.6vw, 22px);\n    color: #12261E;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n\n  .batana-timeline__desc {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.9vw, 15px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #3a3a35;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .batana-timeline__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"batana-timeline\">\n  <h2 class=\"batana-timeline__heading\">Results to expect over time</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"batana-timeline__grid\">\n    <div class=\"batana-timeline__card\">\n      <div class=\"batana-timeline__top\">\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__dot\"><span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__badge\">Day 1-3</div>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"batana-timeline__title\">Instant Cooling &amp; Hydration</h3>\n      <p class=\"batana-timeline__desc\">The CoolTouch applicator depuffs on contact while the serum absorbs fast, leaving under-eyes feeling refreshed and less tight. Skin already looks smoother and more awake.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"batana-timeline__card\">\n      <div class=\"batana-timeline__top\">\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__dot\"><span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__badge\">Week 1&ndash;2</div>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"batana-timeline__title\">Fewer Fine Lines, Less Puffiness</h3>\n      <p class=\"batana-timeline__desc\">Consistent use starts smoothing fine lines and reducing morning puffiness. Peptides and niacinamide get to work on elasticity, and the under-eye area looks noticeably more rested.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"batana-timeline__card\">\n      <div class=\"batana-timeline__top\">\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__dot\"><span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__badge\">Week 3&ndash;4</div>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"batana-timeline__title\">Dark Circles Begin to Fade</h3>\n      <p class=\"batana-timeline__desc\">Skin tone starts to even out as brightening actives target discoloration. Wrinkle depth and length continue improving, giving eyes a visibly brighter, more open look.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"batana-timeline__card\">\n      <div class=\"batana-timeline__top\">\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__dot\"><span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"batana-timeline__badge\">Month 2+</div>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"batana-timeline__title\">Firmer, Brighter, More Youthful Eyes</h3>\n      <p class=\"batana-timeline__desc\">Elasticity keeps improving, fine lines stay visibly softened, and dark circles &amp; puffiness continue to fade. With regular use, the whole eye area looks firmer, brighter, and consistently well-rested.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "full_width": false,
        "show_divider": false,
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "custom_liquid_bt3pmE": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .eyepuff-reviews {\n    background-color: #FBF8ED;\n    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 56px) clamp(20px, 6vw, 56px);\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 48px);\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    color: #1B3B2F;\n    margin: 0 0 clamp(12px, 2vw, 16px) 0;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__subtext {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 2.2vw, 18px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #2b2b28;\n    max-width: 640px;\n    margin: 0 auto clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px) auto;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__card {\n    background-color: #FFFFFF;\n    border: 1px solid #E3E0D2;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 26px);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__stars {\n    color: #F2B84D;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 17px);\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__text {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.9vw, 15px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #2b2b28;\n    margin: 0 0 clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 22px) 0;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__person {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__avatar {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-color: #E4D3AE;\n    color: #1B3B2F;\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__meta {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__name {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #12261E;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__location {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #6b6a63;\n  }\n\n  .eyepuff-reviews__verified {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #4FA187;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 860px) {\n    .eyepuff-reviews__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 560px) {\n    .eyepuff-reviews__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"eyepuff-reviews\">\n  <h2 class=\"eyepuff-reviews__heading\">Loved by tired eyes everywhere</h2>\n  <p class=\"eyepuff-reviews__subtext\">\n    Real results from real customers. Here&rsquo;s what they&rsquo;re saying after adding our eye cream to their routine.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__grid\">\n    <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__card\">\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"eyepuff-reviews__text\">My under-eye bags were so bad I stopped taking morning photos. Two weeks in and coworkers keep asking if I slept more. I haven&rsquo;t, I just found this.</p>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__person\">\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__avatar\">RH</div>\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__meta\">\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__name\">Rania Haddad</span>\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__location\">Beirut, Lebanon</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__verified\">&#10003; Verified purchase</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__card\">\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"eyepuff-reviews__text\">I have sensitive skin and every de-puffing product I tried left me red and irritated. This one is the first that actually calmed the puffiness from day one.</p>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__person\">\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__avatar\">MK</div>\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__meta\">\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__name\">Maya Khoury</span>\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__location\">Jounieh, Lebanon</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__verified\">&#10003; Verified purchase</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__card\">\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"eyepuff-reviews__text\">Not sticky at all, which was my biggest fear with an eye cream. Absorbs fast and my makeup artist actually asked what I changed because my under-eyes look so much smoother.</p>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__person\">\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__avatar\">JN</div>\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__meta\">\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__name\">Joelle Nassar</span>\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__location\">Zahle, Lebanon</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__verified\">&#10003; Verified purchase</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__card\">\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"eyepuff-reviews__text\">The puffiness has calmed down so much I stopped dreading video calls. My dark circles near my nose are finally fading after years of hiding behind concealer.</p>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__person\">\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__avatar\">SC</div>\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__meta\">\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__name\">Sarah Abou Chakra</span>\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__location\">Tripoli, Lebanon</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__verified\">&#10003; Verified purchase</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__card\">\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"eyepuff-reviews__text\">Honestly skeptical at first because I&rsquo;ve tried every miracle eye cream out there. By week three the puffiness was noticeably less and my under-eyes don&rsquo;t feel tight anymore.</p>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__person\">\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__avatar\">FK</div>\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__meta\">\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__name\">Farah Karam</span>\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__location\">Saida, Lebanon</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__verified\">&#10003; Verified purchase</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__card\">\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n      <p class=\"eyepuff-reviews__text\">I use it every morning and my sister already noticed how much brighter my eyes look. Feels cool and refreshing too, not heavy like the creams I used before.</p>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__person\">\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__avatar\">CN</div>\n        <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__meta\">\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__name\">Christelle Nader</span>\n          <span class=\"eyepuff-reviews__location\">Byblos, Lebanon</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"eyepuff-reviews__verified\">&#10003; Verified purchase</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
